21. AI Error Handling
AI services can occasionally return invalid, incomplete, or unusable results.
The implementation should therefore include:
AI Request
    ↓
Response Received?
   / \
 No   Yes
 ↓     ↓
Retry  Validate
       ↓
   Valid JSON?
      / \
    No   Yes
    ↓      ↓
Retry/    Save
Fallback
The UI should display a useful status such as:
"Story generation failed. Please try again."
rather than exposing internal API errors.
