Expected Development Result
The completed ComicCraft system will allow a user to start with a simple story idea and progressively turn it into an editable comic:
Idea → AI Story → Characters → Scenes → Panels → Dialogue → Visuals → Edited Comic → Preview → Export
This development approach keeps the core AI functionality central while ensuring that users remain able to review and modify the generated content before producing the final comic.

